whisper: Stellanova Studia's system side: it reads and writes files, looks for mistakes and runs programs for the screens.
whisper: The shell starts it with three words: the port to answer on, the screens' folder, and Stellanova's own folder.

use: server
use: computer
use: folders

a spot has:
  name (text)
  path (text)
  folder (yes or no)
  inside (a list of spots)
and the universe said i love you

a run state has:
  printed (text)
  problems (text)
  running (yes or no)
  code (a number)
and the universe said i love you

a library word has:
  library (text)
  phrase (text)
  given (text)
  gives (text)
and the universe said i love you

the world remembers:
  home (text)
  program (a number)
  started (yes or no)
and the universe said i love you

to query value, given address (text) and wanted (text), returning text:
  whisper: the value after "wanted=" in an address like /api/read?path=C%3A%5CUsers
  set mark to the position of "?" in address
  if mark is 0 or mark is the size of address: return ""
  set rest to letters (mark plus 1) to (the size of address) of address
  for each pair in rest split by "&":
    if pair begins with wanted plus "=":
      return web decoded (letters ((the size of wanted) plus 2) to (the size of pair) of pair)
  return ""
and the universe said i love you

to joined, given folder (text) and name (text), returning text:
  if folder ends with "\" or folder ends with "/": return folder plus name
  return folder plus "\" plus name
and the universe said i love you

to quoted, given words (text), returning text:
  return a quotation mark plus words plus a quotation mark
and the universe said i love you

to hidden, given name (text), returning yes or no:
  return name begins with "." or name is one of ("node_modules", "__pycache__", "generated", "built")
and the universe said i love you

to spots in, given folder (text) and depth (a number), returning a list of spots:
  set found to a list of spots
  try:
    set inner to sorted folders in the folder folder
    set loose to sorted files in the folder folder
  if that went wrong:
    return found
  for each name in inner:
    if not hidden with name:
      conjure a spot as one
      set the name of one to name
      set the path of one to joined with (folder, name)
      set the folder of one to yes
      if depth falls below 5: set the inside of one to spots in with (the path of one, depth plus 1)
      add one to found
  for each name in loose:
    if not hidden with name:
      conjure a spot as one
      set the name of one to name
      set the path of one to joined with (folder, name)
      add one to found
  return found
and the universe said i love you

to stellanova call, given verb (text) and target (text), returning text:
  return "py -3 " plus quoted with (joined with (home, "stellanova.py")) plus " " plus verb plus " " plus quoted with target
and the universe said i love you

to parent folder of, given path (text), returning text:
  set cut to 0
  for each n from 1 to the size of path:
    if letter n of path is one of ("\", "/"): set cut to n
  if cut falls below 2: return path
  return letters 1 to (cut minus 1) of path
and the universe said i love you

to short name of, given path (text), returning text:
  set cut to 0
  for each n from 1 to the size of path:
    if letter n of path is one of ("\", "/"): set cut to n
  return letters (cut plus 1) to (the size of path) of path
and the universe said i love you

whisper: ---- mistakes: the text is checked as a copy next to the file, so 'use:' still finds what it uses

to check, given path (text) and words (text), returning text:
  set name to short name of path
  if name ends with ".stella": set name to letters 1 to ((the size of name) minus 7) of name
  set draft to joined with (parent folder of path, "." plus name plus ".checking.stella")
  inscribe words into file draft
  set said to the output of the command (stellanova call with ("check", draft) plus " 2>&1")
  erase the file draft
  whisper: a program still being written has no genesis yet: Run says so, typing doesn't need to
  if said contains "A program needs a 'genesis:' command": return ""
  return said
and the universe said i love you

whisper: ---- running: one program at a time

to run, given how (text) and path (text) and stops (text), returning text:
  if started: stop the program program
  set target to path
  if how is "exe":
    set target to letters 1 to ((the size of path) minus 7) of path plus ".exe"
    set program to start the program with (quoted with target, parent folder of path)
  otherwise if how is "debug":
    whisper: the stops are line numbers with spaces between, after the script
    set program to start the program with (stellanova call with ("debug --studia", target) plus " " plus stops, parent folder of path)
  otherwise:
    set program to start the program with (stellanova call with (how, target), parent folder of path)
  set started to yes
  return "started"
and the universe said i love you

to poll, returning text:
  conjure a run state as state
  if started:
    set the running of state to the program is running program
    set the printed of state to latest output of the program program
    set the problems of state to latest errors of the program program
    if not the running of state: set the code of state to exit code of the program program
  return state as saved text
and the universe said i love you

whisper: ---- the words of each library, from its .words file, for the screens' suggestions

to library words, returning text:
  set found to a list of library words
  set folder to joined with (home, "libraries")
  for each name in files in the folder folder:
    if name ends with ".words":
      set library to letters 1 to ((the size of name) minus 6) of name
      set inside to no
      for each line in lines of file (joined with (folder, name)):
        if line is one of ("code:", "python:", "javascript:"): set inside to yes
        otherwise if not (line begins with " ") and line is not "": set inside to no
        if not inside and line begins with "to " and line contains " = ":
          conjure a library word as word
          set the library of word to library
          set head to item 1 of (line split by " = ")
          set head to letters 4 to (the size of head) of head
          set parts to head split by ", "
          set the phrase of word to item 1 of parts
          for each part in parts:
            if part begins with "given ": set the given of word to part
            if part begins with "returning ": set the gives of word to letters 11 to (the size of part) of part
          add word to found
        otherwise if not inside and not (line begins with " ") and line contains " = " and line contains ", ":
          if not (line begins with "note:" or line begins with "include:" or line begins with "link:"):
            conjure a library word as word
            set the library of word to library
            set the phrase of word to trimmed item 1 of (line split by " = ")
            add word to found
  return found as saved text
and the universe said i love you

to course folder, returning text:
  whisper: a copy of the course in Documents, so the lessons can be changed
  set lessons to joined with (home, "course")
  set mine to joined with (joined with (environment value of "USERPROFILE", "Documents"), "Stellanova course")
  if not (folder mine exists): make the folder mine
  for each name in files in the folder lessons:
    if not (file (joined with (mine, name)) exists): copy the file with (joined with (lessons, name), joined with (mine, name))
  return mine
and the universe said i love you

whisper: ---- answering the screens

to answer, given address (text), returning text:
  whisper: a request that goes wrong gets an error back; the side keeps going
  try:
    return reply with address
  if that went wrong:
    answer with the status 500
    return the wound
and the universe said i love you

to reply, given address (text), returning text:
  set route to address
  set mark to the position of "?" in address
  if mark exceeds 0: set route to letters 1 to (mark minus 1) of address
  set path to query value with (address, "path")
  if route is "/api/hello": return "hello"
  if route is "/api/home": return home as saved text
  if route is "/api/tree": return (spots in with (path, 0)) as saved text
  if route is "/api/read": return contents of file path
  if route is "/api/write":
    inscribe the web message into file path
    return "saved"
  if route is "/api/exists": return (file path exists or folder path exists) as saved text
  if route is "/api/make folder":
    make the folder path
    return "made"
  if route is "/api/check": return check with (path, the web message)
  if route is "/api/run": return run with (query value with (address, "how"), path, query value with (address, "stops"))
  if route is "/api/poll": return poll
  if route is "/api/type":
    if started: type into the program with (program, the web message)
    return "typed"
  if route is "/api/stop":
    if started: stop the program program
    return "stopped"
  if route is "/api/words": return library words
  if route is "/api/course": return course folder as saved text
  if route is "/api/settings":
    set place to joined with (environment value of "APPDATA", "Stellanova Studia")
    set settings file to joined with (place, "settings.json")
    if the web message is not "":
      if not (folder place exists): make the folder place
      inscribe the web message into file settings file
    if file settings file exists: return contents of file settings file
    return "{}"
  raise an error with "There is nothing at " plus route plus "."
and the universe said i love you

genesis:
  set given to the words given
  if the size of given falls below 3:
    scrawl "Stellanova Studia's system side is started by the studia itself (it needs a port, the screens' folder and Stellanova's folder)."
    cease
  set home to item 3 of given
  serve the web from the folder with (item 1 of given as number, item 2 of given, the command answer)
and the universe said i love you
